<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-044" chapter-id="c-jinshu-044-cuiyue" source-id="s-jinshu-044-cuiyue">
  <p id="c-jinshu-044-cuiyue:line074" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-044-cuiyue:line074:m0000" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v">悅</persName>字<persName id="c-jinshu-044-cuiyue:line074:m0002" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v">道儒</persName>，魏司空<persName id="c-jinshu-044-cuiyue:line074:m0008" ref="cvr_exv_dku">林</persName>曾孫，<persName id="c-jinshu-044-cuiyue:line074:m0012" ref="b21_e55_8bd">劉琨</persName>妻子之侄也。與<persName id="c-jinshu-044-cuiyue:line074:m0021" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA">諶</persName>俱為<persName id="c-jinshu-044-cuiyue:line074:m0024" ref="b21_e55_8bd">琨</persName>司空從事中郎，後為<persName id="c-jinshu-044-cuiyue:line074:m0034" ref="92h_q40_d2s">末波</persName>佐史。沒石氏，亦居大官。其<persName id="c-jinshu-044-cuiyue:line074:m0049" ref="yoo_ox0_545_FAAABB">綽</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-044-cuiyue:line074:m0051" ref="c6e_8f3_014">憲</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-044-cuiyue:line074:m0053" ref="258_ae3_26e">暢</persName>並別有傳。</p>
</text>
